  "title": "Grandma Ruth's Stuffing",
  "description": "A basic bread stuffing using eggs and canned chicken broth to moisten and bind the bread with the onions, celery and seasonings. This recipe makes enough to dress an 18 to 20 pound bird.",
  "authors": [
    "Ilene F"
  ],
